<title>USA: Richardson, Texas, won by AG Edwards.</title>
<headline>Richardson, Texas, won by AG Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it won $7.905 million of Richardson, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997 with a net interest cost of 5.52 percent.</p>
